               <title>Inactive Ingredients</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>BHT, C 12- 15 Alkyl Benzoat, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Ceresin, Flavor, Methylparaben, Propylparaben, PVP/Hexadecene Copolymer, Synthetic Beeswax, Tocopherol, Zinc Oxide. </paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20130429"/>
            </section>
